From c8e3aebe2e625dd53f0267ab2efd4da35ee80d7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:02:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/18] Round 10: Run eight lanes for full catchment records of
 a known class

Full catchment records whose recharge exponent is exactly 1 or 2 now
run in groups of up to eight lanes, like lean scores; the dynamic
class, with its power call, keeps four. The step functions are
unchanged, so results are bit-identical; the existing uniform-class
lane tests cover the new widths in full mode.

Workload: domain (48 full catchment records of 2,400 days), 11 samples
against round 9.
Before median: 1.178 ms. After median: 0.776 ms. Speedup: 1.52x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
